### Variabel. Isi token dari respons login sebelum request yang membutuhkan auth.
@base = http://localhost:8000
@tokenAdmin = ganti-dengan-token-admin
@tokenUser = ganti-dengan-token-user

### 1. Login admin benar
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2a. Login username salah
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bukan-akun",
  "password": "apa-saja"
}

### 2b. Login password salah
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "salah"
}

### 3. Ulangi login gagal sampai 6 kali untuk melihat 429
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "brute",
  "password": "salah"
}

### 4a. Me tanpa token
GET {{base}}/me

### 4b. Token rusak
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer aaa.bbb.ccc

### 4c. Header bukan Bearer
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Token abc

### 5. Me dengan token admin
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 6. Daftar dan detail sebagai user
GET {{base}}/pengumuman
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###
GET {{base}}/pengumuman/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 7. Id tidak valid dan data tidak ada
GET {{base}}/pengumuman/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###
GET {{base}}/pengumuman/-1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###
GET {{base}}/pengumuman/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 8. Tambah sebagai user (403) lalu sebagai admin (201)
POST {{base}}/pengumuman
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode_info": "INFO-UJI",
  "judul": "Uji tambah",
  "kategori": "Umum",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-06",
  "penulis": "Penguji",
  "jumlah_dibaca": 1
}

###
POST {{base}}/pengumuman
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode_info": "INFO-UJI",
  "judul": "Uji tambah",
  "kategori": "Umum",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-06",
  "penulis": "Penguji",
  "jumlah_dibaca": 1
}

### 9. Kode info kembar
POST {{base}}/pengumuman
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode_info": "INFO-001",
  "judul": "Duplikat",
  "kategori": "Umum",
  "tanggal": "2026-11-06",
  "penulis": "Penguji",
  "jumlah_dibaca": 0
}

### 10. Validasi gagal
POST {{base}}/pengumuman
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode_info": "",
  "judul": "",
  "kategori": "",
  "tanggal": "06-11-2026",
  "penulis": "",
  "jumlah_dibaca": -3
}

### 11. Ubah lalu hapus
PUT {{base}}/pengumuman/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode_info": "INFO-001",
  "judul": "Jadwal UTS Semester Ganjil (diperbarui)",
  "kategori": "Akademik",
  "tanggal": "2026-10-06",
  "penulis": "Biro Akademik",
  "jumlah_dibaca": 121
}

### Hapus sebagai user
DELETE {{base}}/pengumuman/9
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Hapus sebagai admin
DELETE {{base}}/pengumuman/9
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 12. Log
GET {{base}}/log?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
GET {{base}}/log
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Route tidak ada dan method tidak diizinkan
GET {{base}}/tidak-ada
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
POST {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
